# Xcode Build

- Do NOT use Xcode MCP tools (discover_projects, list_schemes, build commands, etc.) to build the project. The user will handle building in Xcode directly.
- This project uses `PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup`, so new files added to the `hardway-craps/` source directory are automatically included in the Xcode project. No manual `project.pbxproj` edits are needed for adding files.
